OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 MAR
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GAlisa Weilerstein and Marin Alsop
OL,6,     Gare live in the studio ahead of
OL,7,     Gtheir concert with the LPO. Also,
OL,8,     GPetroc is joined by the Hastings
OL,9,     GInternational Piano Competition
OL,10,     Gwinner.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GThe BBC National Orchestra and
OL,16,     GChorus of Wales and conductor
OL,17,     GMichal Nesterowicz perform
OL,18,     GGorecki's Three Pieces in Old
OL,19,     GStyle, Poulenc's Gloria, and
OL,20,     GDvorak's 8th Symphony.
